flowchart TB
  patients[Patients] --> browser[Browser: Jinja HTML / Bootstrap / vanilla JS / Chart.js]
  admins[Hospital workspace administrators] --> browser
  browser -->|HTTPS pages + JSON polling| edge[Render HTTPS edge]
  edge --> gunicorn[Gunicorn WSGI: 1 worker / 4 threads]
  gunicorn --> security[Flask application factory + security hooks]
  security --> routes[Public / Auth / Patient / Admin / Forecast blueprints]
  routes --> services[Booking / Inventory / Notifications / Security / Forecast services]
  services --> orm[Flask-SQLAlchemy]
  orm --> postgres[(Render managed PostgreSQL)]
  directory[Checked-in Pune directory + labeled evaluation data] -->|Idempotent seeding| postgres
  browser -->|User taps tel:| phone[Device dialer / calling app]
  local[Local development] -.-> sqlite[(Local SQLite)]
